#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_AccentedLetters)
#. +> trunk stable
#: advanced.ui:48
msgid "Type accented &letters"
msgstr "&Bookstaven mit Akzenten ingeven"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_AccentedLetters)
#. +> trunk stable
#: advanced.ui:51 languageui.ui:25
msgid ""
"If this is checked, you have to type accented letters yourself (i.e. they are "
"differentiated from the corresponding unaccented letter)."
msgstr ""
"Wenn dit anmaakt is, muttst Du Bookstaven mit Akzenten sülvst ingeven (d.h., "
"dat sünd anner Bookstaven as de ahn Akzenten)."

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_AccentedLetters)
#. +> trunk stable
#: advanced.ui:55 languageui.ui:29
msgid ""
"If this is <b>disabled</b>, the selected language does not support it. If "
"this is <b>enabled</b> and if you check it, then you should type accented "
"letters on their own. If it is not checked, accented letters will be "
"displayed with normal letters (default).<br>"
"\n"
"For example, in Catalan, if this is unchecked and you type \"o\", the o and ò "
"will be displayed in the word <b>xenofòbia</b>. If this option is checked, "
"when you type \"o\", only \"o\" will be displayed and you will have to type "
"\"ò\" for this letter to be displayed."
msgstr ""
"Wenn dit <b>nich verföögbor</b> is, ünnerstütt de utsöchte Spraak dat nich. "
"Is dit <b>verföögbor</b> un Du maakst dat an, muttst Du Bookstaven mit "
"Akzenten för sik sülven ingeven. Is dat nich anmaakt, warrt Bookstaven mit "
"Akzenten as de normalen Bookstaven wiest (Standard).<br>"
"\n"
"Wenn dit för a.B. Katalaansch utmaakt is, un Du en \"o\" ingiffst, warrt "
"\"o\" un \"ò\" in't Woort <b>xenofòbia</b> wiest. Wenn disse Optschoon "
"anmaakt is, warrt bloots dat \"o\" wiest, wenn Du \"o\" ingiffst, un Du "
"muttst dat \"ò\" ingeven, dormit dat wiest warrt."

#. i18n: ectx: property (title), widget (QGroupBox, groupBox4)
#. +> trunk stable
#: advanced.ui:73
msgid "German"
msgstr "Hoochdüütsch"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_UpperCase)
#. +> trunk stable
#: advanced.ui:85
msgid "Play in upper case letters"
msgstr "Mit Grootbookstaven spelen"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_UpperCase)
#. +> trunk stable
#: advanced.ui:88
msgid "If checked, the word will be displayed all in upper case letters"
msgstr "Is dit anmaakt, warrt dat Woort bloots mit Grootbookstaven wiest"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_UpperCase)
#. +> trunk stable
#: advanced.ui:92
msgid ""
"If this is checked, the word will be displayed in upper case letters, even if "
"you enter them in lower case. If this is unchecked (default), the word will "
"be in lower case.<br>"
"\n"
"This setting is currently only available for the German language."
msgstr ""
"Is dit anmaakt, warrt dat Woort mit Grootbookstaven wiest, ok wenn Du "
"Lüttbookstaven ingiffst. Is dat nich anmaakt (de Vörinstellen), warrt "
"Lüttbookstaven bruukt.<br>"
"\n"
"Disse Optschoon is opstunns bloots för Hoochdüütsch verföögbor."

#. +> trunk stable
#: data.i18n:2
msgctxt "NOTE_TO_THE_TRANSLATORS"
msgid ""
"The translators have the opportunity to translate the\n"
"words in the game.\n"
"See the file README.languages in khangman's source directory\n"
"for more information on how to do that.\n"
"(translate this message as \"DONE\" when you have translated\n"
"the words; otherwise leave it untranslated as a reminder)"
msgstr "DONE"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QWidget, generalui)
#. +> trunk stable
#: generalui.ui:14
msgid "Here you can choose settings for all languages."
msgstr "Hier kannst Du Optschonen för all Spraken fastleggen"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_OneLetter)
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (OneLetter), group (General)
#. +> trunk stable
#: generalui.ui:22 khangman.kcfg:44
msgid ""
"Check this if you do not want to discover each instance of the same letter."
msgstr ""
"Maak dit an, wenn Du nich fuurts all Vörkamen vun een Bookstaav wiest hebben "
"wullt"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_OneLetter)
#. +> trunk stable
#: generalui.ui:28
msgid ""
"If you check this box, only the first letter will be written if the letter is "
"found in several places in the word. Then you have to rechoose the same "
"letter, to replace the second instance in the word until there are no more "
"instances of this letter.\n"
"For example, the word to guess is \"potato\". If this option is unchecked, "
"when you try \"o\", the two instances of \"o\" in the word will be discovered "
"at the same time. If this is checked, you will need to try \"o\" twice.\n"
"\n"
"Default is that for one letter typed, all instances of that letter in the "
"word are discovered."
msgstr ""
"Wenn dit anmaakt is, warrt bloots een Bookstaav opdeckt, wenn dat Woort den "
"Bookstaav mehr as eenmaal bargt. Wenn Du den Bookstaav nochmaal versöchst, "
"warrt dat twete Vörkamen opdeckt usw., bet de Bookstaav nich mehr binnen dat "
"Woort vörkummt.\n"
"Dat Woort, dat raadt warrn schall, is a.B. \"Kantüffel\". Wenn disse "
"Optschoon ut is, un Du en \"f\" versöchst, warrt fuurts beed \"f\" opdeckt. "
"Wenn dit anmaakt is, muttst Du dat \"f\" tweemaal versöken.\n"
"\n"
"Standardwies warrt bi en richtig Bookstaav all sien Vörkamen binnen dat Woort "
"wiest."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, kcfg_OneLetter)
#. +> trunk stable
#: generalui.ui:31
msgid "Require more guesses for duplicate letters"
msgstr "För dubbelt Bookstaven doot mehr Versöök noot"

