#: timerui.ui:34
msgid "Time for displaying the <b>Already Guessed Letter</b> tooltip:"
msgstr "Duer, för de de \"Al raadt Bookstaav\"-Mellen wiest warrt:"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QSlider, kcfg_MissedTimer)
#. +> trunk stable
#: timerui.ui:44
msgid ""
"You can set the time for displaying the \"Already Guessed\" tooltip after you "
"tried a letter that was already guessed. Default is 1 second but younger "
"children might need longer time to be able to understand they are trying a "
"letter that was already guessed."
msgstr ""
"Du kannst de Wiestiet för de \"Al raadt\"-Mellen fastleggen. Se warrt wiest, "
"wenn Du en Bookstaav utprobeerst, den Du vördem al raadt harrst. De Standard "
"is 1 Sekunn, man lütter Kinner bruukt sachs wat länger, ehr se begrepen "
"hebbt, se probeert en Bookstaav ut, de al raadt wöör."

